  {
   "id": "savara-317700@major-2026-02-16",
   "gameId": "savara-317700",
   "displayName": "Free \"Full Contact\" update now available!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-16T17:30:17.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The free \"Full Contact\" update is now out, promising new ways of taking out your aggression on your hapless opponents!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45184311/e85df4eb627390beb34ce82b899ebcebfe584025.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After a year marked by the start of Iop's festivities in 2025, followed by two free content updates, Savara is now introducing a third batch of content that includes a new weapon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Good Things Come In Threes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's already been almost a year since the palace opened its doors to all those in search of epic brawling action! Though it's not quite over yet, that first year has been supported by the palace Blacksmith's tireless efforts to design a number of innovative weapons to bring greater versatility to your fights:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Spear, offering fearsome attack speed and agility",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Hammer, to hit hard and destroy everything that stands in your way",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And starting today, take your destiny into your own hands with a devastating new weapon: the Fists.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Hit 'Em Where It Hurts",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In a way, we're going back to our roots with this weapon. Iop suggests using your fists instead of your brain to deal with the obstacles in your path. It's not about fighting with your bare hands, though – you'll be equipping a new weapon from the Blacksmith.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Put on these Fists and punish your foes with a rapid-fire series of devastating hits!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How to Equip and Use the New Weapon",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As usual, you can acquire and equip the Fists by talking to the Blacksmith. And just as in earlier content updates, this new weapon also has different variants related to the various monster families.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
