  {
   "id": "savara-317700@major-2025-05-27",
   "gameId": "savara-317700",
   "displayName": "Free Content Update \"Frenzy\" Available Now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-27T09:00:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Savara is getting its first free content update; read about it and take a look here.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This update ushers in a new weapon and a new category of blessings for even more variety in battle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Weapons to Destroy Them All: Spears",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you haven't yet found your perfect weapon, we have news that should delight warriors searching for mobility! With spears, discover a new way of fighting and their unique and divinely efficient tactics against opponents.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Aim with precision and break different parts of the monsters standing in your way. Exploit their weaknesses and do even more damage by hitting 'em where it hurts!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How to Equip and Use a Spear",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To equip a spear in one of Savara's weapon slots, simply head to the blacksmith.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There, you can examine your new favorite weapons – their specific details, variants, and looks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "A Collector's Skin for Even More Style",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A little extra bonus has slipped into the \"Legacy of the Heavens\" collector's edition of Savara. It would be a shame to head into battle with a new weapon that didn't go with the rest of your outfit. Owners of the collector's edition can get this gift from Iop for free and give their spear a brand-new appearance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Category of Blessings Available: Frenzy",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hit fast to hit harder to hit even FASTER! When Frenzy takes hold of Savara, nothing can stop her!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "This new category of blessing introduces a full 30 variants to wake your inner Iop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "With Frenzy, kick up your gameplay a notch and make your battles even more epic and intense than they already were.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Check Out This Free Update Now!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What? Why are you still here? Jump into the fray!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
